---
import { CalendarDays, MapPin, MessageSquareText } from '@lucide/astro';
import EnquiryForm from './EnquiryForm.astro';
---

<section class="section enquiry-band" id="enquire">
  <div class="shell enquiry-layout">
    <div class="enquiry-intro">
      <h2>Tell us what you are trying to send</h2>
      <p>Share the occasion, date, delivery area, budget, preferred style, and any practical constraints. Those details make it easier to understand the request and identify what still needs to be confirmed.</p>
      <div class="trust-item"><CalendarDays size={22} aria-hidden="true" /><div><h3>Date first</h3><span>Include the required date and a useful delivery window. Timing affects flower availability, preparation, transport, and whether the recipient can receive the order.</span></div></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><MapPin size={22} aria-hidden="true" /><div><h3>Location matters</h3><span>Provide the postal code, unit number, venue name, access instructions, and recipient contact. Building rules and handover arrangements can change the delivery plan.</span></div></div>
      <div class="trust-item"><MessageSquareText size={22} aria-hidden="true" /><div><h3>Keep the message clear</h3><span>Put the flower preferences, card wording, recipient details, and delivery notes in one place so the important instructions can be checked together.</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <EnquiryForm />
  </div>
</section>
